          "label": "Search query",
          "value": "<p>Create a query that satisfies <b>all</b> selected criteria: every label, extractor and annotator you pick must match (AND query). The only OR is the optional annotated text, which matches if it appears in <i>any</i> of the annotators chosen for it.</p>",
